From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: N0zoM1z0 <161784452+N0zoM1z0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 22:59:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Put all of main_01 into one main_01_TEXT segment

All intra-group far calls in the original are shortened, so a single
segment lets TLINK reproduce them and the eight inline-asm call
stand-ins become natural calls. pointnum_put() is ZUN's hand-written
assembly and moves into its own module between pointnum and shot.
